{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The source explicitly delays election and append acknowledgments until persistence completes. It also treats stale storage responses differently: stale entry acknowledgments are ignored, while snapshot completion is retained as committed state. I’ll trace the response producer and consumption paths to understand that boundary before selecting a candidate.\n"}}
